# Frontend Design System

Source of truth: [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md). Read it before UI work.

## Non-negotiables

- **Primary kit:** shadcn-vue under `resources/js/Components/ui/*` + Tailwind utilities
- **CLI:** `shadcn-vue@0.11.4` / radix (Tailwind v3) only — e.g. `./node_modules/.bin/shadcn-vue add <name> -y`. Do not use `@latest` or upgrade to Tailwind 4 unless asked
- **Tokens:** use semantic theme colors from `resources/css/app.css` / `tailwind.config.js`; no arbitrary hex sprawl
- **Reuse order:** existing `ui/` → existing app components (`PageHeader`, `DataTable`, …) → compose with Tailwind → extract shared → custom CSS last
- **Preserve:** Inertia behavior, props/events, permissions, API contracts, `AuthenticatedLayout` / `GuestLayout` unless asked to redesign
- **No mass page refactors** to shadcn unless explicitly requested; new/changed UI uses `ui/` first
- **Do not** invent parallel button/input/dialog styles or duplicate components

## App composition (keep)

`PageHeader`, `SectionCard`, `DataTable`, `FilterBar`, `EmptyState`, `StatusBadge`, `FlashAlerts`, `Breadcrumbs`, `Pagination`, `AppSidebar`, domain widgets (`TaskKanban`, `ScheduleGantt`, `ImprovementWorkspace`).
